date-released: 2026-09-02
abstract: >-
  ACE-S is a portable context-selection meta-skill for AI agents. It routes
  context problems, selects retrieval scope and fidelity, preserves provenance,
  and stops expansion when the available evidence is sufficient.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - context-engineering
  - retrieval
